    "text": "mynewsla.com\nwebsite\nThousand Palms\nPerson Arrested; One Injured After Hit-and-Run in Thousand Palms\nBy Contributing Editor,\n3 hours agoA two-vehicle collision in Thousand Palms Wednesday left one person injured and second in custody on suspicion of hit-and-run. Deputies responded to a call regarding a suspicious circumstance at 2:52 p.m. Wednesday in the area of Pet Land Place and Rio Del Sol Drive, according to sheriff’s Lt. Deirdre Vickers. Deputies determined that a two-vehicle collision had occurred, with one of the drivers attempting to flee the location while a person from the other car jumped on the moving vehicle’s hood, Vickers said.\n1",
